2:Tfd3,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/figma-weave-alternative#article","headline":"The best Figma Weave alternative for generative design","description":"Looking for a Figma Weave (Weavy) alternative? Weave puts a generation canvas next to your design files, great if you live in Figma. If you don't, the ecosystem coupling and fast credit burn become constraints. Here's how Melius compares as a standalone, canvas-first workspace with an agent and one credit pool.","url":"https://www.melius.com/blog/figma-weave-alternative","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/figma-weave-alternative"},"datePublished":"2026-07-21","dateModified":"2026-07-21","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Melius Team","url":"https://www.melius.com"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#organization"},"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#website"},"inLanguage":"en-US","image":"https://www.melius.com/images/blog/figma-weave-alternative/cover.webp","timeRequired":"PT6M","wordCount":635,"articleSection":"Comparisons","keywords":"Comparisons"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Blog","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"The best Figma Weave alternative for generative design","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog/figma-weave-alternative"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best Figma Weave alternative?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Melius is the strongest standalone alternative to Figma Weave. Both are node-based generation canvases with broad model access, but Melius is an independent creative workspace rather than a layer tied to the Figma ecosystem, it adds Mel to plan and wire multi-step work, and it keeps every model under one credit pool."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is Melius different from Figma Weave?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The biggest difference is the agent. Figma Weave has no AI agent, so its node graphs are wired and run by hand, and it is deeply tied to Figma's ecosystem. Melius is a standalone, agent-first workspace: Mel builds and runs the graph from a brief and also works in Slack, its MCP is canvas-level so an external agent like Claude can drive the canvas from any host, and every model shares one subscription."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Figma Weave the same as Weavy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Weavy was the original node-based generation canvas; Figma acquired it and rebranded it Figma Weave, folding it into Figma Design. So a Weavy alternative and a Figma Weave alternative are the same search. If you want that node-canvas-plus-generation model but without the Figma coupling, Melius is a standalone equivalent with an agent and one shared credit pool."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why do people look for a Figma Weave alternative?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The dominant complaint is credit cost: users report credits burning extremely fast, sometimes thousands of credits for a few minutes of work, with iterative fixes for AI mistakes eating more. There are also reports of billing friction on cancellation, and some tooling is still in open beta. Teams outside the Figma ecosystem also want a standalone option."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Melius integrate with design tools?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Melius exposes an MCP server, so an agent like Claude can read and act on your canvas from your own environment. Rather than binding generation to one design suite, it aims to be model-agnostic and host-agnostic so it fits whatever workflow you already use."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Melius sequence video like Weave's Timeline?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Melius includes an in-app multi-track editor for arranging shots, timing and layering audio, alongside the node canvas for building the generations that feed it."}}]}]}7:X
