15:["$","ul","b1192-parent",{"children":[["$","li","b1192",{"children":[["$","strong","b1190",{"children":["No agent, fully manual. "]}],"This is the biggest gap. Where the rest of the field has some kind of AI agent, Weave's node graphs are wired and run by hand, so someone has to build every pipeline. There's also no announced Slack, MCP, API or CLI to drive it from elsewhere."]}],["$","li","b1195",{"children":[["$","strong","b1193",{"children":["Credits burn fast. "]}],"A dominant complaint: users report thousands of credits consumed for a few minutes of work, with iterative fixes for AI mistakes, effectively paying to troubleshoot the tool, eating still more."]}],["$","li","b1198",{"children":[["$","strong","b1196",{"children":["Ecosystem lock-in. "]}],"Weave's value is tightly coupled to Figma's world, and there's no audio or voice. If your team isn't Figma-first, much of the advantage doesn't apply."]}],["$","li","b1201",{"children":[["$","strong","b1199",{"children":["Mid-acquisition uncertainty. "]}],"Some embedded tooling and the full Figma-to-Weave sync are still rolling out through beta, so the roadmap is moving while Figma folds it in."]}]]}]
16:["$","h2","b1203",{"id":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","className":"scroll-mt-28","children":["How Melius approaches the same work"]}]
17:["$","p","b1205",{"children":["Melius is a standalone, agent-first workspace, so the thing Weave leaves to you, building and running the graph, is exactly what the agent does."]}]
18:["$","ul","b1208-parent",{"children":[["$","li","b1208",{"children":[["$","strong","b1206",{"children":["An agent instead of manual wiring. "]}],"Mel reads your brief, picks a model per step, wires the node graph, runs it, and writes each per-model prompt, so multi-step work starts from intent, not hand assembly. It also runs in Slack and can carry your brand context and skills into every generation."]}],["$","li","b1211",{"children":[["$","strong","b1209",{"children":["Drivable from your own tools. "]}],"A canvas-level MCP means an external agent like Claude can build and run the Melius canvas from your own environment, rather than binding your generations to a single design suite. Several agents can also work one canvas at once with visible presence."]}],["$","li","b1217",{"children":[["$","strong","b1212",{"children":["Generation, audio and assembly in one place. "]}],"Image, video and audio models (including voice and music) live on the same canvas, with an in-app multi-track editor to sequence and export, all under ",["$","$L2b","b1215",{"link":{"_type":"link","_key":"b1214","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false},"children":["a single subscription"]}]," with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage."]}],["$","li","b1220",{"children":[["$","strong","b1218",{"children":["Real-time multiplayer for the team. "]}],"A whole team works the same canvas live, without depending on one design ecosystem's rollout schedule."]}],["$","li","b1223",{"children":[["$","strong","b1221",{"children":["Assets you can actually find. "]}],"Every generation and upload lands in a semantic asset library you search by what's in the image, not a flat pile of files to scroll through later."]}]]}]
19:["$","div","b1224",{"role":"region","aria-label":"Comparison table, scroll horizontally to see all columns","tabIndex":0,"data-lenis-prevent":true,"className":"my-10 max-w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-white shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-orange","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left","children":["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","b1225",{"className":"bg-black/[0.04]","children":[["$","td","b12250",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-gray-dark-1 px-4 py-3 font-medium","children":[["$","p","b1228",{"children":[["$","strong","b1227",{"children":[""]}]]}]]}],["$","td","b12251",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-gray-dark-1 px-4 py-3 font-medium","children":[["$","p","b1231",{"children":[["$","strong","b1230",{"children":["Melius"]}]]}]]}],["$","td","b12252",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-gray-dark-1 px-4 py-3 font-medium","children":[["$","p","b1234",{"children":[["$","strong","b1233",{"children":["Figma Weave"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1235",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b12350",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1238",{"children":["Node-based canvas"]}]]}],["$","td","b12351",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1241",{"children":["Yes"]}]]}],["$","td","b12352",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1244",{"children":["Yes"]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1245",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b12450",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1248",{"children":["AI agent"]}]]}],["$","td","b12451",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1251",{"children":["Operates the canvas + Slack"]}]]}],["$","td","b12452",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1254",{"children":["None, fully manual"]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1255",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b12550",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1258",{"children":["Standalone or tied"]}]]}],["$","td","b12551",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1261",{"children":["Standalone workspace"]}]]}],["$","td","b12552",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1264",{"children":["Coupled to Figma ecosystem"]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1265",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b12650",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1268",{"children":["Drive from other tools"]}]]}],["$","td","b12651",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1271",{"children":["Canvas-level MCP, any host"]}]]}],["$","td","b12652",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1274",{"children":["None announced"]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1275",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b12750",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1278",{"children":["Audio / voice"]}]]}],["$","td","b12751",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1281",{"children":["Voice, music & speech-to-text"]}]]}],["$","td","b12752",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":[["$","p","b1284",{"children":["None"]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","b1285",{"className":"border-t border-black/10","children":[["$","td","b12850",{"className":"t-b-3 min-w-48 align-top [&_p]:m-0 text-foreground px-4 py-3.5","children":"$L2c"}],"$L2d","$L2e"]}]]}]}]}]
